# 10/28/26 My fursona!
Yesterday my fursona reference sheet was completed!! Take a look:

![My fursona, it's a crow with dog ears. The title says "Crownana the robotic crow-dog" Design notes: no hooked beak, bird talon feet, fluffy neck, dog ears, ombre hair, dot matrix eyes, "mask" face pattern. Outfit: sleeveless hoddie, bell bottom jeans, striped t-shirt. Nickname: crow. Pronouns: they/them/she/her. Likes: shiny objects, bones, rewatching tv shows, meditation, old things, photography, collecting things, purple. Dislikes: cheese curds, scary things, negativity, migrating.](/resources/blog/10.28.26%20fursona.png)

It was created by my good friend [Nintendoge](https://www.instagram.com/gg.d0ggy/) with design direction input from me. It's a cross species mix, 80% crow, 10% dog, 10% robot. I'm planning on turning this into a fursuit in the future now! I've already ordered materials to create the feet, and I'll work my way up from there. I'm not 100% sure how I'll do the wings or head yet, but I'm confident that with time I'll figure out how to turn this into a real physical thing somehow. And if I can't I'll pay someone else to do it. I think I can do a reasonable job with some effort over time though.